    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is designed with only the roulette wheel function. It does not include betting features or additional rules, focusing purely on simulating the operation of a roulette wheel in a simple design. It supports both the American and European types.\u200b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By default, the game allows a limited number of spins per session. You can restart the app to continue enjoying the experience. For those who prefer unlimited spins without restarting, an optional DLC (&quot;Roulette Wheel Full Version&quot;) is available to remove this limitation.\u200b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
